From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] preserve pinhole lease identities and action results

Renew only the selected lease UID without relabeling unrelated entries.
Keep backend failure distinct from an absent pinhole in SOAP replies, and
report lease publication separately from live-kernel mutation.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
